   "http_status": 200,
   "answer_text": "The schools are ranked by average Writing score (all above 499) with their charter numbers:\n1. Pacific Collegiate Charter \u2013 Charter 0210 \u2013 Avg Writing 630\n2. University High \u2013 Charter 0890 \u2013 Avg Writing 593\n3. OCSA \u2013 Charter 0290 \u2013 Avg Writing 582\n4. Alameda Community Learning Center \u2013 Charter 0352 \u2013 Avg Writing 581\n5. Northcoast Preparatory and Performing Arts Academy \u2013 Charter 0930 \u2013 Avg Writing 579\n6. John Adams Academy \u2013 Charter 1169 \u2013 Avg Writing 576\n7. Inspire School of Arts and Sciences \u2013 Charter 1114 \u2013 Avg Writing 562\n8. Da Vinci Charter Academy \u2013 Charter 1079 \u2013 Avg Writing 558\n9. River Valley Charter \u2013 Charter 0120 \u2013 Avg Writing 555\n10. Ocean Grove Charter \u2013 Charter 0747 \u2013 Avg Writing 554\n... (continues through all 58 schools, ending with Cypress Charter High \u2013 Charter 0512 \u2013 Avg Writing 506).",
   "detail": null,
   "route": "sql",
   "executed_sql": "SELECT sch.school AS school_name, sch.charternum AS charter_number, s.avgscrwrite AS avg_writing_score\nFROM cn_9240ceb08edb4938.satscores AS s\nJOIN cn_9240ceb08edb4938.schools AS sch ON s.cds = sch.cdscode\nWHERE s.avgscrwrite > 499\n  AND sch.charternum IS NOT NULL\nORDER BY s.avgscrwrite DESC\nLIMIT 1000",
