   "answer_text": "No schools meet the criteria; there are no locally funded schools with a K-12 enrollment minus 15-17 enrollment difference above the average.",
   "detail": null,
   "route": "sql",
   "executed_sql": "SELECT f.\"School Name\" AS school_name, s.doctype\nFROM cn_9240ceb08edb4938.frpm AS f\nJOIN cn_9240ceb08edb4938.schools AS s ON f.cdscode = s.cdscode\nWHERE s.fundingtype = 'Local'\n  AND (f.\"Enrollment (K-12)\" - f.\"Enrollment (Ages 5-17)\") > (\n        SELECT AVG(f2.\"Enrollment (K-12)\" - f2.\"Enrollment (Ages 5-17)\")\n        FROM cn_9240ceb08edb4938.frpm AS f2\n        JOIN cn_9240ceb08edb4938.schools AS s2 ON f2.cdscode = s2.cdscode\n        WHERE s2.fundingtype = 'Local'\n      )\nLIMIT 1000",
